            "review_title": "Review at Délices De Mai Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Jenny Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam20 contributions\n0\nFood review\nMar 2025 • Friends\nAn affordable French restaurant with a mix of Vietnamese and foreign customers. Their dishes are absolutely delicious, but the waiting time is quite long. However, all the guests seem happy to wait, which makes me believe they are repeat customers who find it worth the wait. Eventually, I like this place❤️\nWritten March 18, 2025",
